Inspect or mutate the candidate-only cross-Work-Item coordination store

Usage: ai-cockpit work-item coordination <COMMAND>

Commands:
  inspect                   
  register                  
  report-impact             
  publish-outcome           
  request-pause             
  acknowledge               
  resume                    
  recover                   
  check-environment-drift   Check for unrecorded Runtime-observed environment drift without writing
  record-environment-drift  Persist Runtime-observed environment drift before a dependent action
  help                      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
